{"id": "side-doors-of-influence", "title": "Side doors of influence: gifts to departments, and ballot donors later paid by the measure", "seconds": 134.7, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "dcfe1b43859589f7", "words": 415, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "Campaign checks and registered lobbyists are the front door to influence.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.51, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["the front door", "campaign checks, registered lobbyists"], "b": ["the side doors", "gifts, friends-of groups, ballot measures, seats"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.4, 0.76, 0.85, 1.33, 1.85, 1.98, 2.11, 2.33, 2.59, 2.73]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "suspicious[0]"], "text": "First, gifts to City departments. In two years, how much did they report?", "t0": 3.63, "t1": 8.52, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Gifts to departments", "sub": "reported monthly by the departments"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.69, 0.93, 1.03, 1.29, 2.33, 2.96, 3.18, 3.74, 3.88, 4.06, 4.14, 4.3]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "amount", "timeline[2]"], "text": "39.7 million dollars.", "t0": 8.52, "t1": 10.88, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$39.7 million", "label": "1,933 gifts, November 2024 to October 2026"}, "emph": ["39.7"], "wt": [0.04, 0.88, 1.19, 1.4, 1.81]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["status", "innocent[0]"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding. Almost all of it is disclosed, as the rules ask.", "t0": 11.4, "t1": 15.49, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.3, 0.4, 0.9, 1.03, 1.11, 1.55, 2.1, 2.24, 2.36, 2.44, 2.59, 3.18, 3.28, 3.38, 3.68]}, {"scene": "gift", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "Police got the most: 15.3 million dollars.", "t0": 15.71, "t1": 18.72, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Gifts reported, November 2024 to October 2026", "rows": [["Police", "$15.3 million"], ["Mayor’s Office", "$7.7 million"], ["Arts Commission, from San Francisco Symphony", "$2.2 million"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.43, 0.55, 1.2, 1.6, 1.9, 2.05, 2.4]}, {"scene": "gift", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "suspicious[0].why"], "text": "For 14, a contract with that department began within a year of a gift.", "t0": 18.84, "t1": 22.49, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "Within a year", "sub": "14 donors began a contract with that department"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.91, 1.03, 1.46, 1.55, 1.75, 2.18, 2.54, 2.74, 2.83, 3.09, 3.26, 3.38]}, {"scene": "gift", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[4]", "suspicious[0].what"], "text": "Their own cover pages show more: 41.9 million dollars on original filings, and 1.8 million on amendments.", "t0": 22.61, "t1": 29.41, "shot": "b5a", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["itemised gift list", "$39.7 million"], "b": ["cover pages, original filings", "$41.9 million"]}, "emph": ["41.9 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.24, 0.47, 0.78, 1.01, 1.79, 2.28, 2.65, 2.87, 3.32, 3.63, 3.71, 4.07, 4.78, 4.93, 5.13, 5.43, 5.59, 5.94, 6.13]}, {"scene": "friends", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The Controller lists friends-of groups raising money for departments.", "t0": 29.63, "t1": 32.51, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "San Francisco Police Community Foundation", "kicker": "On neither Controller list", "chip": "$13.4 million to Police"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.52, 0.84, 1.25, 1.57, 1.84, 2.08, 2.17]}, {"scene": "friends", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The biggest giver is on neither list: the San Francisco Police Community Foundation.", "t0": 32.63, "t1": 37.3, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "San Francisco Police Community Foundation", "kicker": "On neither Controller list", "chip": "$13.4 million to Police"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.46, 0.82, 1.07, 1.24, 1.59, 2.35, 2.45, 2.65, 3.11, 3.44, 3.85]}, {"scene": "friends", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "notEstablished[2]", "suspicious[1].why"], "text": "It gave Police 13.4 million dollars. Whether it must be listed isn’t established.", "t0": 37.42, "t1": 42.48, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "San Francisco Police Community Foundation", "kicker": "On neither Controller list", "chip": "$13.4 million to Police"}, "emph": ["13.4 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.35, 0.68, 1.1, 1.46, 1.62, 2.02, 2.64, 3.15, 3.28, 3.48, 3.63, 4.07, 4.66]}, {"scene": "measure", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "story[12]"], "text": "Next, ballot measures. 35 organizations gave 1.0 million dollars to measure campaigns.", "t0": 42.7, "t1": 48.35, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Ballot measures", "sub": "bonds and dedicated funds, 16 followed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.65, 0.92, 1.41, 2.52, 3.12, 3.33, 3.54, 3.84, 3.99, 4.33, 4.7, 4.78, 5.06]}, {"scene": "measure", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "story[12]"], "text": "What did those funds later pay them?", "t0": 48.47, "t1": 49.9, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Ballot measures", "sub": "bonds and dedicated funds, 16 followed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.22, 0.45, 0.76, 0.97, 1.15]}, {"scene": "measure", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "oneLine"], "text": "383.0 million dollars.", "t0": 49.9, "t1": 53.52, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$383.0 million", "label": "paid from the funds of the measures they backed"}, "emph": ["383.0"], "wt": [0.04, 0.87, 1.26, 1.82, 2.22, 2.55, 3.07]}, {"scene": "measure", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "Charles Pankow Builders gave 2,500 dollars to a health and safety bond campaign.", "t0": 54.04, "t1": 58.28, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["gave the Public Health and Safety bond campaign", "$2,500"], "b": ["paid from that bond’s fund", "$79.7 million"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.61, 0.93, 1.09, 1.28, 1.63, 1.86, 2.09, 2.46, 2.57, 2.67, 2.86, 2.95, 3.28, 3.5]}, {"scene": "measure", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "It was paid 79.7 million from that bond.", "t0": 58.4, "t1": 61.0, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["gave the Public Health and Safety bond campaign", "$2,500"], "b": ["paid from that bond’s fund", "$79.7 million"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.22, 0.47, 0.95, 1.25, 1.42, 1.81, 1.99, 2.17]}, {"scene": "measure", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why", "suspicious[2].what"], "text": "A token gift is not a price. And donor and payee are matched by name alone.", "t0": 61.12, "t1": 65.2, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["gave the Public Health and Safety bond campaign", "$2,500"], "b": ["paid from that bond’s fund", "$79.7 million"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.4, 0.71, 0.83, 0.97, 1.07, 1.82, 2.11, 2.37, 2.52, 2.92, 3.1, 3.38, 3.51, 3.72]}, {"scene": "seat", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]"], "text": "Then commissioners.", "t0": 65.42, "t1": 66.61, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Architectural Resources Group, Inc.", "kicker": "Historic Preservation Commission", "sub": "on Aaron Hyland’s ownership schedule", "chip": "$617,800"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31]}, {"scene": "seat", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]"], "text": "Aaron Hyland, of the Historic Preservation Commission,", "t0": 66.73, "t1": 69.35, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Architectural Resources Group, Inc.", "kicker": "Historic Preservation Commission", "sub": "on Aaron Hyland’s ownership schedule", "chip": "$617,800"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.82, 0.9, 1.04, 1.44, 1.9]}, {"scene": "seat", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]"], "text": "lists Architectural Resources Group on his ownership schedule.", "t0": 69.35, "t1": 72.19, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Architectural Resources Group, Inc.", "kicker": "Historic Preservation Commission", "sub": "on Aaron Hyland’s ownership schedule", "chip": "$617,800"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.36, 0.97, 1.5, 1.74, 1.82, 1.95, 2.3]}, {"scene": "seat", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]"], "text": "And his own department paid it 617,800 dollars.", "t0": 72.31, "t1": 75.9, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Architectural Resources Group, Inc.", "kicker": "Historic Preservation Commission", "sub": "on Aaron Hyland’s ownership schedule", "chip": "$617,800"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.21, 0.35, 0.81, 1.02, 1.16, 1.34, 1.62, 2.09, 2.49, 2.74, 3.03]}, {"scene": "seat", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "established[6]"], "text": "And an officer named on Mercy Housing California’s tax return", "t0": 76.02, "t1": 78.82, "shot": "b12b", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Mercy Housing California", "kicker": "An officer on its tax return"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.18, 0.57, 0.84, 0.97, 1.24, 1.58, 2.18, 2.39]}, {"scene": "seat", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[6]", "innocent[4]"], "text": "sits on the Housing Authority’s Board of Commissioners.", "t0": 78.82, "t1": 81.17, "shot": "b12a", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Housing Authority Board of Commissioners", "kicker": "Mercy Housing California", "sub": "confirmed by the member’s own Form 700"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.51, 0.62, 0.7, 0.97, 1.43, 1.62, 1.7]}, {"scene": "seat", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[8]"], "text": "He is the housing office’s former director, who sought a waiver in 2011 to join Mercy.", "t0": 81.29, "t1": 85.49, "shot": "b12d", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "Ethics Commission, staff memo of 7 June 2011", "text": "a request to waive the contractor ban: five contracts with Mercy Housing California signed in the year before; staff recommended the waiver", "mark": "2011"}, "emph": ["2011"], "wt": [0.0, 0.04, 0.15, 0.24, 0.57, 0.97, 1.24, 1.72, 1.9, 2.22, 2.32, 2.51, 2.64, 2.9, 3.2, 3.39, 3.65]}, {"scene": "seat", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why", "notEstablished[1]", "story[6]"], "text": "Of 2,336 votes tested, none was on a member’s own business or employer.", "t0": 85.61, "t1": 90.77, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "2,336 votes tested", "sub": "none on a business a member owns or is paid by"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.28, 0.67, 0.87, 1.15, 1.69, 2.02, 2.69, 2.94, 3.08, 3.2, 3.28, 3.69, 3.88, 4.3, 4.49]}, {"scene": "seat", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[7]"], "text": "In December 2023, a lobbyist registration opened under the Planning Commission president’s name.", "t0": 90.89, "t1": 95.69, "shot": "b13t", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "Ethics Commission, lobbyist registration SFO-163353", "text": "opened 13 December 2023 for the firm Venture With Purpose; the only filing under it; no contacts or payments reported", "mark": "13 December 2023"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.05, 0.44, 0.65, 1.44, 1.53, 1.98, 2.52, 2.84, 3.02, 3.11, 3.44, 3.84, 4.27]}, {"scene": "seat", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["established[7]", "notEstablished[4]"], "text": "The firm is one her own Form 700s list. Who filed it, for what client, isn’t shown.", "t0": 95.81, "t1": 100.63, "shot": "b13u", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Who filed the registration, and for which client", "Whether it was opened in error, or for work after she left the Commission"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.32, 0.46, 0.64, 0.79, 1.0, 1.28, 1.94, 2.33, 2.73, 3.05, 3.31, 3.44, 3.59, 4.06, 4.33]}, {"scene": "pen", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]"], "text": "When rules are broken, what’s the typical Ethics Commission penalty?", "t0": 100.85, "t1": 104.05, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "The Ethics Commission’s file", "sub": "164 penalties, 2003 to 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.42, 0.52, 1.23, 1.42, 1.52, 1.91, 2.16, 2.52]}, {"scene": "pen", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "oneLine"], "text": "1,500 dollars.", "t0": 104.05, "t1": 106.25, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1,500", "label": "the median of 164 penalties"}, "emph": ["1,500"], "wt": [0.04, 0.38, 0.81, 1.1, 1.32]}, {"scene": "pen", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[4].what", "suspicious[4].why"], "text": "One commissioner sought a subcontract worth over 2.7 million dollars,", "t0": 106.77, "t1": 110.67, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["a City subcontract sought", "more than $2.7 million"], "b": ["the penalty", "$9,500"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.55, 0.76, 0.85, 1.57, 1.83, 2.06, 2.31, 2.62, 2.84, 3.24]}, {"scene": "pen", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[4].what", "suspicious[4].why"], "text": "and paid 9,500.", "t0": 110.67, "t1": 112.7, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["a City subcontract sought", "more than $2.7 million"], "b": ["the penalty", "$9,500"]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.16, 0.49, 0.81, 1.26, 1.47]}, {"scene": "pen", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[3]", "established[2]"], "text": "From 2022 to 2026, the Commission opened 713 matters,", "t0": 112.82, "t1": 117.34, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["enforcement matters opened, fiscal 2022 to 2026", "713"], "b": ["penalties issued", "52"], "mid": "124 commissioners’ yearly forms filed late"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.36, 0.93, 1.09, 1.29, 2.08, 2.16, 2.57, 2.92, 3.22, 3.44, 3.91]}, {"scene": "pen", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[3]", "established[2]"], "text": "and issued 52 penalties.", "t0": 117.34, "t1": 119.05, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["enforcement matters opened, fiscal 2022 to 2026", "713"], "b": ["penalties issued", "52"], "mid": "124 commissioners’ yearly forms filed late"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.19, 0.54, 1.06]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[3]"], "text": "Nothing shows a gift was given for a contract, or a donation for a payment.", "t0": 119.27, "t1": 122.85, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That any gift was given for a contract", "That any contribution bought a payment"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.36, 0.6, 0.7, 0.9, 1.04, 1.3, 1.43, 1.53, 2.22, 2.3, 2.39, 2.9, 3.03, 3.11]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[1]"], "text": "What would settle it? The donor lists of friends-of groups, and the Police foundation’s agreement with the department.", "t0": 122.97, "t1": 127.85, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The donor lists each support organization must publish"}, {"who": "", "what": "The Police Department’s agreement with the Police Community Foundation"}], "focus": 1}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.24, 0.51, 0.75, 1.06, 1.39, 1.69, 1.78, 2.31, 2.75, 2.82, 2.91, 3.24, 3.92, 4.16, 4.28, 4.38]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["defense[0]"], "text": "We did not reach out to anyone named. No regulator has ruled on it.", "t0": 127.97, "t1": 131.49, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.18, 0.37, 0.57, 0.71, 0.85, 1.19, 1.71, 2.12, 2.63, 2.78, 3.04, 3.18]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 131.61, "t1": 133.83, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.3, 0.41, 0.53, 1.24, 1.39, 1.53]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The side doors", "gift": "Gifts · $39.7 million", "friends": "Friends of · $13.4 million", "measure": "Ballot money · $383.0 million", "seat": "Commissioners", "pen": "Penalties · $1,500", "close": "What would settle it"}, "look": "flow", "hook": "question"}